        ":question/problem": "Find ${h}^{'}(x)$ if $h(x)=4x\\operatorname{csc}(x).$\n\n${h}^{'}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{'}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x\\operatorname{csc}(x)) \\\\  & =4(\\operatorname{csc}(x))+(4x)(-\\operatorname{csc}(x)\\operatorname{cot}(x)) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{csc}(x)-4x\\operatorname{csc}(x)\\operatorname{cot}(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$"
